    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730-a4">

                <pb facs="1320" n="1196" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg1196"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No.
                    287.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Saavedra to Mr.
                            Baker.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-10-18"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 18,
                        1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: In satisfaction of the official
                    letter of your excellency of the 14th of this month, I have the honor to inclose
                    here a statement which expresses as is desired, and year by year, from 1873 to
                    the 30th of June last, inclusive, the product of the thirteen unities applied to
                    the payment of diplomatic credits, and the sum distributed among them, with an
                    expression of the remainders.</p>
                <p>I renew, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>PEDRO I. SAAVEDRA.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
